---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../../components/home/Hero.astro";
import Carousel from "../../components/Carousel.astro";
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="El agua salá — Rural house in Villanueva del Río y Minas, private pool"
  description="Rural house for 2–7 guests near Munigua and Sierra Norte (Seville). Private pool, countryside views and cultural day trips. Book now."
>
  <Hero
    badge="Rural house for up to 7 guests"
    title="Your rural refuge in Villanueva del Rio y Minas"
    subtitle="Disconnect among open views, nature and authentic experiences. Perfect for families, friends and international travelers."
    image="/images/patio-2.png"
    ctaPrimary="Check availability"
    ctaSecondary="View gallery"
    bookingUrl="/reservas"
  />

  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[--color-bg] px-3 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[--color-text] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border] flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 10a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6ZM16 10a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6ZM4 18a6 6 0 0 1 16 0" />
          </svg>
          Up to 7 guests
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[--color-bg] px-3 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[--color-text] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border] flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 13h16v5H4z" />
            <path d="M8 13V8h8v5" />
          </svg>
          3 bedrooms
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[--color-bg] px-3 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[--color-text] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border] flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 12h16" />
            <path d="M6 12V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4" />
            <path d="M7 12v5M17 12v5" />
          </svg>
          2 bathrooms
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[--color-bg] px-3 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[--color-text] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border] flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 11.5c0-1.5 1.5-3 3-3s3 1.5 3 3-1.5 3-3 3-3-1.5-3-3ZM5 13.5a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4ZM15 13.5a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4ZM19 13.5a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4Z" />
          </svg>
          0 pets
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[--color-bg] px-3 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[--color-text] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border] flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" />
            <path d="M7 7l10 10" />
          </svg>
          No celebrations
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[--color-text] md:text-4xl text-center">Discover El agua salá</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[--color-text-muted] text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Explore the cozy spaces of our rural house, designed to offer comfort and tranquility in a unique natural environment.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <Carousel
          images={["salon-1.png", "habitacion-1.png", "cocina-1.png", "patio-1.png", "bano-1.png"]}
          alt="Images of El agua salá house"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-[--color-text-muted] text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          El agua salá is much more than a vacation home; it is a corner of calm designed for those who seek to disconnect without giving up comfort.
          The house, furnished with style, impresses with its elegant combination of modern comfort and traditional charm.
        </p>
        <div id="moreContent" class="hidden mt-6 space-y-6 text-[--color-text-muted] text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Spacious and bright interiors, a cozy living room with a wood-burning fireplace inviting evenings of reading or endless conversations, welcoming bedrooms equipped with air conditioning,
            a well-equipped kitchen for your culinary creations, ideal for your relaxing vacation.
          </p>
          <p>
            The heart of the stay is our large outdoor terrace with fruit trees, where you can enjoy a private salt chlorinated pool and crystal clear waters while taking in the iconic views that immerse you in the Andalusian countryside.
            Relax under the shade of our lemon and orange trees, or enjoy an unforgettable dinner in our outdoor dining area.
          </p>
          <p>
            The pool invites you to take a refreshing dip, while the tranquil location promises pure relaxation.
          </p>
          <p>
            There is much to discover around Villanueva del Río y Minas. Explore the region's rich history, the Roman past with the archaeological site of Munigua,
            and the legacy of the Industrial Revolution with the Minas de la Reunión Historic Complex.
          </p>
          <p>
            Enjoy nature in the nearby Sierra Norte Natural Park and in the beautiful landscapes of the surroundings.
            Take advantage of the proximity to Seville with its magnificent monuments and cultural offerings, and Córdoba with its Mosque. Ideal for day trips.
          </p>
          <p>
            This vacation home is perfect for unforgettable experiences and relaxation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <button id="readMoreBtn" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[--color-brand-700] font-semibold transition-colors hover:text-[--color-brand-800]">
            <span>Read more</span>
            <span id="readMoreArrow" class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200">▼</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
          const btn = document.getElementById('readMoreBtn');
          const content = document.getElementById('moreContent');
          const arrow = document.getElementById('readMoreArrow');
          if (!btn || !content || !arrow) return;

          btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const expand = content.classList.contains('hidden');
            content.classList.toggle('hidden', !expand);
            const label = btn.querySelector('span');
            if (label) label.textContent = expand ? 'Show less' : 'Read more';
            arrow.style.transform = expand ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';
          });
        });
      </script>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-[--color-brand-50]">
    <div class="container-site">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[--color-text] md:text-4xl">Why choose El agua salá</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <article class="card-soft p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[--color-text]">Up to 7 guests</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[--color-text-muted]">Comfortable space for families and groups of friends.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-soft p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[--color-text]">Views and calm</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[--color-text-muted]">Cozy atmosphere to disconnect from daily routine.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-soft p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[--color-text]">Unique experiences</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[--color-text-muted]">Very close to Munigua, routes and natural spots.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-soft p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-[--color-text]">Near Seville</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[--color-text-muted]">Rural tranquility with easy access to the city.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-site grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[--color-brand-700]">Environment</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl text-[--color-text] md:text-4xl">Nature, history and quality plans</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[--color-text-muted]">
          Discover the Roman site of Munigua, stroll along the riverbank and enjoy landscapes that invite you to slow down. The location allows combining relaxation and cultural outings.
        </p>
        <a href="/en/entorno" class="btn-primary mt-6">
          Explore environment
        </a>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/images/paisaje-1.png"
        alt="Landscape and surroundings near the house"
        class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[--color-border]"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-14 md:pb-20">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#5a91c1] p-8 text-white md:p-12">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">The best dates book up fast</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-white">
          Write to us and we'll help you organize an unforgettable stay in Villanueva del Rio y Minas.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/reservas" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#fceedd] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[#2f3a33] transition-colors hover:bg-[#f2cfab] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/80">
            Book now
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/34620880212" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/40 px-6 py-3 font-semibold transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/80">
            Direct WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
